<p>
	Attention: Starting with version 3.0 of the App, the changes to objects
	yet to be or already synchronized are not stored in individual JSON
	files anymore. Instead they are stored in a dedicated database and the
	tool /usr/sbin/univention-ox-connector-task-management has been added
	to interact with it.
</p>
<p>
	The App received a new option to no longer stop on an error, but put it
	aside and continue to process other changes. This option may change the
	bahavior of the App and is by default configured as it was before: The
	Connector will stop on errors.
</p>
<p>
	A list of changes can be found <a
	href="https://docs.software-univention.de/ox-connector-app/latest/changelog.html"
	target="_blank">here</a>.
</p>
